      "body": "Updated to `secp256k1_ge_set_all_gej` in 192db92.\n\nBecause `ecmult_gen_gej` blinds the Jacobian coordinates, running the batch inversion through `fe_inv_var` leaks the context's blinding factor via variable-time divsteps. Non-infinity is already guaranteed by the check in `create_output_pubkey_gej`, so `ge_set_all_gej` drops in cleanly.",
